WEBVTT

00:01:51.972 --> 00:01:54.133
Yes, it's me. What is it?

00:01:54.908 --> 00:01:57.604
An intruder? In the labs?!

00:01:58.145 --> 00:02:00.981
Yes, Sir! But we can't find any
trace of them inside anymore.

00:02:00.981 --> 00:02:03.884
It appears that they have
already fled into the city.

00:02:03.884 --> 00:02:06.553
Access the traffic
monitoring system.

00:02:06.553 --> 00:02:08.987
Scrutinize any vehicles headed
for the city limits.

00:02:15.262 --> 00:02:18.754
This is Daizaburo Gowa. I wish to
speak to the Chief of Police.

00:02:24.805 --> 00:02:26.940
A fire has broken out at the Gowa
Central Research Facility.

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:29.408
All units nearby are requested
to report to the scene.

00:02:35.282 --> 00:02:37.751
Kakio team, don't let the police
or fire department inside.

00:02:37.751 --> 00:02:40.618
Sasaki team, report back
regarding the extent of damages.

00:02:41.555 --> 00:02:43.323
We've just recovered something
the intruders left behind.

00:02:43.323 --> 00:02:45.314
We're getting readings
similar to that of a TA.

00:02:45.826 --> 00:02:47.521
Keep the area clean for
the analysis team.

00:02:48.862 --> 00:02:50.625
I died?

00:02:51.365 --> 00:02:52.855
Over eight years ago?

00:02:53.734 --> 00:02:56.270
What do you mean we're
not going to be let in?!

00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:58.772
We have the situation
well under control.

00:02:58.772 --> 00:02:59.840
This facility has been designated

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:03.310
a Class 3 Sensitive Secrets
Installation by the SSDF.

00:03:03.310 --> 00:03:06.146
But the fire is still
burning, isn't it?!

00:03:06.146 --> 00:03:09.249
This facility is equipped with
adequate fire fighting capacities.

00:03:09.249 --> 00:03:10.739
It will only be a matter of time.

00:03:12.052 --> 00:03:15.756
You're wasting your breath. You
guys are way too dedicated.

00:03:15.756 --> 00:03:17.246
Radio from headquarters, Sir.

00:03:18.158 --> 00:03:19.059
What is it?

00:03:19.059 --> 00:03:19.660
It's weird. Everyone's being told
we have to cordon off the city.
What is it?

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:23.460
It's weird. Everyone's being told
we have to cordon off the city.

00:03:53.293 --> 00:03:54.521
You're fast.

00:03:55.028 --> 00:03:57.155
I came through a checkpoint
on the way here.

00:03:57.664 --> 00:03:59.767
All cars that have left the
city since the intrusion

00:03:59.767 --> 00:04:02.336
were either cars that were passing
through or registered cars.

00:04:02.336 --> 00:04:04.827
The intruders are still
inside the city.

00:04:05.339 --> 00:04:08.475
They certainly put on a
show, didn't they?

00:04:08.475 --> 00:04:11.111
They didn't brief you regarding
the extent of the intrusion?

00:04:11.111 --> 00:04:15.343
No, I came here as soon as I could
when I heard the news in Tokyo.

00:04:15.983 --> 00:04:19.820
The intruders ran off with the
samples that we brought back.

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:23.756
There's a possibility they accessed
the Gowa Intelligence Databank.

00:04:24.491 --> 00:04:29.329
We're decoding the path they used
to access the security system

00:04:29.329 --> 00:04:31.490
and disable the security cameras.

00:04:32.733 --> 00:04:35.327
Decoding completed.
Coming on screen.

00:04:37.004 --> 00:04:39.598
Belgistan TA's?!

00:04:51.218 --> 00:04:53.720
What's going on here?!

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:57.825
Why are you taking this much time
with simple weight inspections?

00:04:57.825 --> 00:05:01.659
I have to get this cargo into
Tokyo by noon tomorrow.

00:05:05.032 --> 00:05:08.866
When did the Gowa City Police
start taking orders from the SSDF?

00:05:11.772 --> 00:05:13.173
Who are you?

00:05:13.173 --> 00:05:17.337
You're not going to investigate
the Gowa facility, are you?

00:05:18.178 --> 00:05:21.348
Each town has their own
way of handling things.

00:05:21.348 --> 00:05:23.373
It's as if martial law
is in effect.

00:05:26.019 --> 00:05:27.187
Who is he?

00:05:27.187 --> 00:05:28.677
Can't say...

00:05:30.991 --> 00:05:33.227
We have not been able to intercept
the intruders' radio transmissions.

00:05:33.227 --> 00:05:35.429
Nothing lighting up
the EMF either.

00:05:35.429 --> 00:05:37.297
Block A and Block B...

00:05:37.297 --> 00:05:40.858
A nighttime curfew is in
effect for Gowa City.

00:05:41.635 --> 00:05:44.331
Please cooperate with instructions
issued by the authorities.

00:05:50.544 --> 00:05:53.775
Hello? Hello? No answer.

00:05:54.481 --> 00:05:56.884
What? You can't get through?

00:05:56.884 --> 00:05:59.253
I could get through before.

00:05:59.253 --> 00:06:01.278
There's so much static.

00:06:02.389 --> 00:06:04.725
...was a calm day.

00:06:04.725 --> 00:06:06.488
And now our last news
piece tonight.

00:06:07.094 --> 00:06:09.796
The opposition parties are
demanding inspections,

00:06:09.796 --> 00:06:15.202
and intend to subpoena testimony
over the Belgistan deployment

00:06:15.202 --> 00:06:18.365
of the tactical weapons that the
SSDF has been developing.

00:06:18.872 --> 00:06:22.672
The government has agreed to
allow an opposition investigation.

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:26.113
The television won't say
anything, I suppose.

00:06:26.113 --> 00:06:28.479
No one will talk about
this, you know.

00:07:05.619 --> 00:07:07.416
Another two hours?

00:07:07.921 --> 00:07:10.424
So, I understand.

00:07:10.424 --> 00:07:14.194
We can't keep the city sealed off
much longer in any case.

00:07:14.194 --> 00:07:15.320
Why?

00:07:16.063 --> 00:07:19.032
Why are the intruders making
their getaway so leisurely?

00:07:19.933 --> 00:07:22.731
What would you do, Chairman?

00:07:23.770 --> 00:07:27.040
If you infiltrated enemy territory
with TA's at your side...

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:30.737
If it were me, the sample is
all that would matter.

00:07:31.244 --> 00:07:34.873
I'd destroy the attention grabbing
TA's, and waste no time escaping.

00:07:35.949 --> 00:07:38.281
Why didn't they take
off immediately?

00:07:39.786 --> 00:07:42.289
I've completed analyzing the
enemy's signature pattern.

00:07:42.289 --> 00:07:44.992
It features a gamma ray emission
pattern characteristic

00:07:44.992 --> 00:07:47.119
of micro-batteries built to
military specifications.

00:07:47.627 --> 00:07:48.895
Can you use it to track
them down?

00:07:48.895 --> 00:07:52.126
If we could get them to resume
action with a tracer ready, yes.

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:56.194
We need to release the
hounds then?

00:08:04.411 --> 00:08:06.747
They seem to have taken the
bait that we left behind.

00:08:06.747 --> 00:08:08.281
Right, release the decoy.

00:08:08.281 --> 00:08:09.771
Yes, Sir.

00:08:14.721 --> 00:08:16.382
Enemy TA!

00:08:17.224 --> 00:08:18.959
Have they caught wind
of our plans?

00:08:18.959 --> 00:08:22.053
Focus the dragnet on the
target in motion!

00:08:41.815 --> 00:08:46.586
Target is at 21-405, heading for
the traffic circle along the river.

00:08:46.586 --> 00:08:47.921
B Company head west
on the interstate.

00:08:47.921 --> 00:08:49.623
They seem to know how we're
reacting to them.
B Company head west
on the interstate.

00:08:49.623 --> 00:08:50.323
They seem to know how we're
reacting to them.
Car 504 head north on T Street
and link up with Car 201.

00:08:50.323 --> 00:08:52.459
This is just like the final moves
in a game of shougi.
Car 504 head north on T Street
and link up with Car 201.

00:08:52.459 --> 00:08:53.293
We must gain a checkmate
no matter what.
Car 504 head north on T Street
and link up with Car 201.

00:08:53.293 --> 00:08:56.023
We must gain a checkmate
no matter what.

00:09:07.774 --> 00:09:09.605
No sign of the target?!

00:09:20.353 --> 00:09:21.911
Impossible! A decoy?

00:09:24.658 --> 00:09:26.426
What is this?

00:09:26.426 --> 00:09:28.758
Access the traffic
monitoring system!

00:09:29.262 --> 00:09:31.492
Search for any vehicles that
just left the city limits.

00:09:32.399 --> 00:09:34.000
It's too late.

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:36.970
Once outside our grasp,

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:40.874
our enemy will dissolve like a drop
of water that's reached the ocean.

00:09:40.874 --> 00:09:42.933
A drop in the ocean...

00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:52.853
We have successfully retreated
from Gowa City.

00:09:52.853 --> 00:09:55.447
Moving on to the search
for the original entity.

00:10:31.324 --> 00:10:32.791
Would you open the door please?

00:10:42.936 --> 00:10:43.737
Here you are.

00:10:43.737 --> 00:10:44.437
Oh, thank you.
Here you are.

00:10:44.437 --> 00:10:45.802
Oh, thank you.

00:10:46.306 --> 00:10:48.934
How long are they going
to keep us in here?

00:10:49.743 --> 00:10:52.179
Until the inspections are
over, I suppose.

00:10:52.179 --> 00:10:54.670
We're the only ones capable
of operating the TA's.

00:10:55.182 --> 00:10:57.984
I'm sure they won't keep us idle
any longer than they must.

00:10:57.984 --> 00:11:01.215
I wonder what happened to Ataka?

00:11:02.222 --> 00:11:05.714
You must be Mr. Wakisaka from
the Public Prosecutor's Office.

00:11:06.993 --> 00:11:10.297
As you're well aware, we're
rather busy right now,

00:11:10.297 --> 00:11:11.531
so I ask that you keep this short.

00:11:11.531 --> 00:11:14.134
What's the deal with Gowa City?

00:11:14.134 --> 00:11:17.433
Is it an independent nation with
the Gowa as it's ruling monarchy?

00:11:18.638 --> 00:11:21.341
We are a part of Japan, of course.

00:11:21.341 --> 00:11:24.310
Well, you could have fooled me
from what I've seen so far.

00:11:26.446 --> 00:11:28.348
Let me get to the point.

00:11:28.348 --> 00:11:33.119
I hear you instructed the Gowa
City Police to obey the SSDF.

00:11:33.119 --> 00:11:36.556
Following an accident in a facility
sensitive to national security.

00:11:36.556 --> 00:11:40.694
I don't think it's odd to have the
SSDF deployed in this situation.

00:11:40.694 --> 00:11:44.357
As I see it, the existence of the
Gowa is way out of the ordinary.

00:11:49.703 --> 00:11:53.106
I understand that you've been in
this city for less than a month.

00:11:53.106 --> 00:11:56.443
You know rural regions operate in
ways very different from Tokyo.

00:11:56.443 --> 00:11:59.003
So, you know all about me.

00:11:59.713 --> 00:12:00.714
Well, you just remember,

00:12:00.714 --> 00:12:04.013
the Public Prosecutors Office
won't be manhandled by the Gowa.

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:08.110
Mr. Wakisaka...

00:12:09.889 --> 00:12:12.425
You won't be able to secure a
warrant to search the premises.

00:12:12.425 --> 00:12:15.121
You'll be wasting your time.
I'm quite certain.

00:12:17.063 --> 00:12:18.826
This city makes me want to puke!

00:12:27.240 --> 00:12:28.575
So what was this checkpoint for?

00:12:28.575 --> 00:12:30.176
Don't go asking
questions like that.

00:12:30.176 --> 00:12:32.701
Quit yapping and get
that stuff stored.

00:12:53.867 --> 00:12:55.357
Who is it?

00:12:59.306 --> 00:13:02.503
What is it? You didn't even bother
to announce yourself.

00:13:05.211 --> 00:13:08.782
Yushiro, are you without a
mouth to speak with?

00:13:08.782 --> 00:13:11.580
Yushiro... Yushiro Gowa...

00:13:14.354 --> 00:13:16.584
Yushiro Gowa's dead.

00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:18.848
He died eight years ago.

00:13:19.526 --> 00:13:22.329
Who told you? Was it your father?

00:13:22.329 --> 00:13:24.797
Or Kazukiyo?

00:13:25.365 --> 00:13:27.567
So, it is true!

00:13:27.567 --> 00:13:31.071
How dare you speak to your
mother in such a tone!

00:13:31.071 --> 00:13:33.707
Are you my mother?

00:13:33.707 --> 00:13:35.197
Well...

00:13:37.344 --> 00:13:38.834
You aren't, are you?

00:13:39.846 --> 00:13:41.336
Then who is?!

00:13:43.516 --> 00:13:45.006
Please answer me!

00:13:46.519 --> 00:13:48.822
Inquire with Master Sorachi.

00:13:48.822 --> 00:13:51.391
He knows everything.

00:13:51.391 --> 00:13:53.723
My master?! Why?

00:13:54.928 --> 00:13:56.418
Why would he know?

00:14:30.463 --> 00:14:31.965
The weather wheel?

00:14:31.965 --> 00:14:33.455
Big brother!

00:14:44.677 --> 00:14:47.612
Yes, brother is back from his trip!

00:14:52.752 --> 00:14:54.242
Big brother!

00:14:55.054 --> 00:14:56.180
Not here...

00:14:56.689 --> 00:14:58.558
Where is he?

00:14:58.558 --> 00:15:00.719
Yushiro is no longer here.

00:15:04.631 --> 00:15:06.166
Mother!

00:15:06.166 --> 00:15:09.102
Big brother did come back,
didn't he?

00:15:09.102 --> 00:15:11.838
Where is he now?

00:15:11.838 --> 00:15:13.169
Yushiro...

00:15:13.673 --> 00:15:15.842
That boy has run off.

00:15:15.842 --> 00:15:17.332
He's run off?

00:15:17.911 --> 00:15:20.480
Where? Where is he going?

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:22.782
Misuzu, you must forget him.

00:15:22.782 --> 00:15:25.273
Yushiro will not be returning
to us again.

00:15:25.785 --> 00:15:28.254
He has run off.

00:15:28.254 --> 00:15:30.457
Where? Where?!

00:15:30.457 --> 00:15:34.727
Please tell me where! Where
has my big brother gone?

00:15:34.727 --> 00:15:36.329
You must give him up!

00:15:36.329 --> 00:15:39.355
Mother! Mother...

00:15:43.002 --> 00:15:45.271
To the home of the Gowa.

00:15:45.271 --> 00:15:49.799
Yes, he will never come
back to us again.

00:15:51.311 --> 00:15:52.801
Kinashi?

00:16:03.323 --> 00:16:04.984
A message from home?

00:16:05.592 --> 00:16:07.082
An intruder?

00:16:08.228 --> 00:16:10.253
Yushiro is missing?

00:16:46.266 --> 00:16:47.600
Pardon me!

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:52.071
I was told that the Gowa residence
was in this neighborhood.

00:16:52.071 --> 00:16:54.240
Actually, this is the Gowa's.

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:57.677
He lives on a spread like this?

00:16:57.677 --> 00:16:59.379
Who might you be visiting?

00:16:59.379 --> 00:17:01.481
Oh, yes, I'm looking for someone.

00:17:01.481 --> 00:17:06.486
I'm looking for Yushiro.
Yushiro Gowa, to be specific.

00:17:06.486 --> 00:17:08.254
My big brother?

00:17:08.254 --> 00:17:09.744
Big brother?

00:17:22.402 --> 00:17:24.666
So, you're Yushiro's
younger sister?

00:17:26.739 --> 00:17:30.106
What are you to my brother?

00:17:31.044 --> 00:17:34.480
I'm only a co-worker,
so don't get me wrong.

00:17:34.480 --> 00:17:35.748
You work with him?

00:17:35.748 --> 00:17:37.682
Only a co-worker, I guess.

00:17:59.205 --> 00:18:00.866
I've been expecting you.

00:18:07.180 --> 00:18:08.670
Master!

00:18:11.884 --> 00:18:15.650
My earliest memories are of
dancing on this stage.

00:18:16.322 --> 00:18:19.425
Ever since I was little, I danced as
you taught me in your lessons.

00:18:19.425 --> 00:18:22.895
Dancing is your purpose in life.

00:18:22.895 --> 00:18:26.165
There is no need for any
other memories.

00:18:26.165 --> 00:18:29.535
If I were dead, there would be no
need for memories at all.

00:18:29.535 --> 00:18:33.806
What do you propose, digging up
memories you do not have?

00:18:33.806 --> 00:18:36.798
I... I want to know who I am.

00:18:39.212 --> 00:18:41.442
Would you please cast your
gaze over there?

00:18:43.683 --> 00:18:47.353
Kinashi was once the home of
the Gowa mansion.

00:18:47.353 --> 00:18:50.923
Eighty years ago, the house was
moved to where it stands now.

00:18:50.923 --> 00:18:56.362
But they left the storehouse here,
where it still stands today.

00:18:56.362 --> 00:18:59.126
No, to be precise they had no
choice but to leave it here.

00:18:59.899 --> 00:19:01.401
The storehouse?

00:19:01.401 --> 00:19:06.134
It is where you store the memories
of the past, Master Yushiro.

00:19:57.056 --> 00:19:58.546
What is this?

00:20:15.575 --> 00:20:17.133
What is this place for?

00:20:23.649 --> 00:20:26.675
We'll have to walk the
rest of the way.

00:20:27.787 --> 00:20:29.277
Let's go!

00:20:43.002 --> 00:20:44.492
What is this place?

00:20:52.945 --> 00:20:55.675
Are you the real Yushiro?

00:21:02.922 --> 00:21:05.618
That's my son, Kuya.

00:21:13.099 --> 00:21:14.834
What is this place?

00:21:14.834 --> 00:21:17.428
This is the stage where
my brother dances.

00:21:18.204 --> 00:21:19.605
Stage?

00:21:19.605 --> 00:21:21.207
According to the data
from yesterday,

00:21:21.207 --> 00:21:26.045
the original must be stored within
a 120m radius from Point Zero.

00:21:26.045 --> 00:21:27.580
F-1 to Command Base.

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:29.882
No signs of enemy
detection systems.

00:21:29.882 --> 00:21:31.918
F-1, move to Program O.

00:21:31.918 --> 00:21:32.952
Wait.

00:21:32.952 --> 00:21:33.419
Big brother!
Wait.

00:21:33.419 --> 00:21:35.114
Big brother!

00:21:36.055 --> 00:21:37.579
What is this place?

00:21:38.090 --> 00:21:40.183
Who are all these people here?

00:21:42.628 --> 00:21:46.792
Those who summon Gasaraki. The
descendents of the Monoyose kai.

00:21:47.466 --> 00:21:48.956
Gasaraki?

00:22:04.617 --> 00:22:06.949
Big brother!

00:22:07.954 --> 00:22:08.855
Misuzu?

00:22:08.855 --> 00:22:09.455
Big brother!
Misuzu?

00:22:09.455 --> 00:22:11.116
Big brother!

00:22:18.731 --> 00:22:20.366
What the hell are they
doing here!?

00:22:20.366 --> 00:22:21.767
Run!

00:22:21.767 --> 00:22:23.394
Big brother!

00:24:00.833 --> 00:24:05.395
The blood rushes toward my heart
as if squeezed out of my limbs.

00:24:05.972 --> 00:24:09.100
But wait, it's not blood that's
rushing up toward my heart.

00:24:09.842 --> 00:24:11.639
Tremendous stretches
of time, gush by,

00:24:12.144 --> 00:24:13.941
flowing from my own fate.

00:24:14.847 --> 00:24:16.349
Thou the kugai

00:24:16.349 --> 00:24:18.918
Passages throughout the body,
through the darkness

00:24:18.918 --> 00:24:22.188
The unbroken line of kai, like
beads stretching back in time

00:24:22.188 --> 00:24:24.724
As fragments of memories of
times past spatter about,

00:24:24.724 --> 00:24:27.625
a thousand years of
history gush past.
